{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":80,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director: according to shoshannim-eduth. Of Asaph. A Psalm","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director: according to "},{"t":"shoshannim","s":["H7802"]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"eduth","s":["H7802"]},{"t":". Of "},{"t":"Asaph","s":["H0623"],"a":[4]},{"t":". A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[5]}]},{"n":1,"text":"O Shepherd of Israel, give ear, You who lead Joseph like a flock; You who are enthroned between the cherubim, shine forth.","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H0238"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Shepherd","s":["H7462"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[1]},{"t":", give "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0238"],"a":[2]},{"t":", You who "},{"t":"lead","s":["H5090"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Joseph","s":["H3130"],"a":[5]},{"t":" like a "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; You who are enthroned between the "},{"t":"cherubim","s":["H3742"],"a":[7]},{"t":", shine "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3313"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Before Ephraim and Benjamin and Manasseh Stir up Your might, And come to save us.","tok":[{"t":"Before","s":["H6440"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Benjamin","s":["H1144"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Manasseh","s":["H4519"],"a":[3]},{"t":" Stir "},{"t":"up","s":["H5782"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Your might, And "},{"t":"come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"save","s":["H3444"],"a":[8]},{"t":" us."}]},{"n":3,"text":"O God, restore us; And cause Your face to shine, and we will be saved.","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H7725"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":", restore us; And cause Your "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and we will be "},{"t":"saved","s":["H3467"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"O Jehovah God of hosts, How long will You fume Against the prayer of Your people?","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[2]},{"t":", How long will You fume Against the "},{"t":"prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":5,"text":"You have fed them with the bread of tears And have made them drink tears in large measure.","tok":[{"t":"You have fed them with the "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And have made them "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8248"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"large","s":["H8248"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"measure","s":["H7991"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"You have made us a cause of strife to our neighbors, And our enemies deride us among themselves.","tok":[{"t":"You have made us a cause of "},{"t":"strife","s":["H4066"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to our neighbors, And our "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" deride us among themselves."}]},{"n":7,"text":"O God of hosts, restore us; And cause Your face to shine, and we will be saved.","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H7725"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":", restore us; And cause Your "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and we will be "},{"t":"saved","s":["H3467"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"You brought a vine out of Egypt; You drove out nations and planted it;","tok":[{"t":"You "},{"t":"brought","s":["H5265"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[0]},{"t":" out of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; You drove "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"planted","s":["H5193"],"a":[5]},{"t":" it;"}]},{"n":9,"text":"You cleared the ground before it, And it took deep root and filled the land.","tok":[{"t":"You cleared the ground "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it, And it took "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8328"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"root","s":["H8327"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"filled","s":["H4390"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The mountains were covered with its shadow, And its boughs were like the cedars of God.","tok":[{"t":"The mountains were "},{"t":"covered","s":["H3680"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with its "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And its "},{"t":"boughs","s":["H6057"],"a":[3]},{"t":" were like the "},{"t":"cedars","s":["H0730"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of God."}]},{"n":11,"text":"It put forth its branches unto the sea, And its shoots unto the River.","tok":[{"t":"It put forth its "},{"t":"branches","s":["H3127"],"a":[6]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And its shoots unto the "},{"t":"River","s":["H5104"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Why have You broken down its hedges, So that all who pass by on the way pluck it?","tok":[{"t":"Why have You broken "},{"t":"down","s":["H6555"],"a":[1]},{"t":" its "},{"t":"hedges","s":["H1447"],"a":[2]},{"t":", So that all who "},{"t":"pass","s":["H5674"],"a":[5]},{"t":" by on the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pluck","s":["H0717"],"a":[3]},{"t":" it?"}]},{"n":13,"text":"The boar from the forest ravages it, And that which moves through the field feeds on it.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"boar","s":["H2386"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the forest ravages it, And that which moves through the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"feeds","s":["H7462"],"a":[5]},{"t":" on it."}]},{"n":14,"text":"O God of hosts, turn, we beseech You; Look down from heaven and see, And visit this vine,","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H7725"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":", turn, we beseech You; Look "},{"t":"down","s":["H5027"],"a":[4]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"visit","s":["H6485"],"a":[7]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[8]},{"t":","}]},{"n":15,"text":"Even the stock which Your right hand has planted And the son whom You have strengthened for Yourself.","tok":[{"t":"Even the stock which Your right "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3225"],"a":[3]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"planted","s":["H5193"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And the son whom You have strengthened for Yourself."}]},{"n":16,"text":"It is burned with fire; it is cut down; They perish at the rebuke of Your countenance.","tok":[{"t":"It is "},{"t":"burned","s":["H8313"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; it is cut "},{"t":"down","s":["H3683"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[5]},{"t":" at the "},{"t":"rebuke","s":["H1606"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"countenance","s":["H6440"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Let Your hand be upon the man of Your right hand, Upon the son of man whom You have strengthened for Yourself;","tok":[{"t":"Let Your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" be upon the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of Your right "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3225"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Upon the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[7]},{"t":" whom You have strengthened for Yourself;"}]},{"n":18,"text":"Then we will not turn back from You. Revive us, and we will call upon Your name.","tok":[{"t":"Then we will not turn "},{"t":"back","s":["H5472"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from You. Revive us, and we will "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[5]},{"t":" upon Your "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"O Jehovah God of hosts, restore us; Cause Your face to shine, and we will be saved.","tok":[{"t":"O","s":["H7725"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[2]},{"t":", restore us; Cause Your "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"shine","s":["H0215"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and we will be "},{"t":"saved","s":["H3467"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]}]}
